    openai["«external system»<br/><b>OpenAI Platform</b><br/>Generates the flashcards, note and test from<br/>extracted text, and answers the chatbot"]

    youtube["«external system»<br/><b>YouTube</b><br/>Transcripts for a pasted video link"]

    web["«external system»<br/><b>Web pages</b><br/>Article text behind a pasted URL"]

